== Notable Racial Distinctions ==
<ul>
  <li>'''Dark Elves:''' [[Dark Elf|Dark Elves]] tie for second-best wisdom and can [[hide]], which is useful since Clerics can't cast [[Invisibility]].  However, because all good races start out hating them they can only use evil-aligned vendors until they improve their faction with each good city they visit.
     <ul>
     <li>[[Dark Elf|Dark Elves]] can only worship [[Innoruuk]], and can get the {{:Regent Symbol of Innoruuk}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Innoruuk}}</li>
     </ul>
  </li>
  <li>'''Dwarves:''' [[Dwarf|Dwarves]] are tied for second-best wisdom and have a unique "barrel roll" animation (with no in-game benefit). They also have the highest strength and stamina scores which helps with carrying capacity and more hit points respectively.
     <ul>
     <li>[[Dwarf|Dwarves]] can only worship [[Brell Serilis]], and can get the {{:Disciple Symbol of Brell Serilis}} and other  {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Brell Serilis}}</li>
     </ul>
  </li>
  <li>'''Erudite:''' [[Erudite|Erudites]] are tied for second-best wisdom and have poor night vision. All Erudite Clerics can wear the {{:Fright Forged Helm}}, which grants infravision, but only [[Cazic Thule]] worshippers can easily get the faction for it.
     <ul>
     <li>[[Cazic-Thule]] Worshipers can get the {{:Disciple Symbol of Cazic Thule}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Cazic Thule}}</li>
     <li>[[Prexus]] Worshipers do not get a symbol quest but can wear a few {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Prexus}}</li>
     <li>[[Quellious]] Worshipers can get the {{:Regent Symbol of Quellious}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Quellious}}</li>
     </ul>
  </li>
  <li>'''Gnomes:''' [[Gnome]]s have the lowest wisdom, but their small size is an advantage in dungeons, and they can learn [[Tinkering]], allowing them to make (Cleric-wearable) [[Clockwork Watchman Armor]].
     <ul>
     <li>[[Bristlebane]]-worshipers can get {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Bristlebane}}</li>
     <li>[[Brell Serilis]]-worshipers can get the {{:Disciple Symbol of Brell Serilis}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Brell Serilis}}</li>
     <li>[[Bertoxxulous]]-worshipers can get the {{:Initiate Symbol of Bertoxxulous}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Bertoxxulous}}</li>
     </ul>
  </li>
  <li>'''Halflings:''' [[Halfling]] can both [[hide]] and [[sneak]] (very useful since Clerics can't cast [[Invisibility]]), but consume food faster.
     <ul>
     <li>[[Halfling]]s can only worship [[Bristlebane]] and don't get a symbol quest, but can wear other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Bristlebane}}</li>
     </ul>
  </li>
  <li>'''High Elves:''' [[High Elf|High Elves]] have the highest wisdom.
     <ul>
     <li>[[High Elf|High Elves]] can only worship [[Tunare]], and can get the {{:Warden Symbol of Tunare}}, {{:Symbol of Tunarian Worship}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Tunare}}</li>
     </ul>
  </li>
  <li>'''Humans:''' [[Human]]s have poor night vision. All Human Clerics can wear (but harder to get faction as a good religion) the {{:Fright Forged Helm}} which grants infravision.
     <ul>
     <li>[[Bertoxxulous]]-worshipers can get the {{:Initiate Symbol of Bertoxxulous}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Bertoxxulous}}.</li>
     <li>[[Innoruuk]]-worshipers can get the {{:Regent Symbol of Innoruuk}} and other {{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Innoruuk}}.  Also their faction lets them complete quests for {{:Dread Forged Shield}}, {{:Fright Forged Helm}} (an [[Advanced_Techniques_Guide#Resetting_Spell_Refresh_Timers_With_Instant-Click_Items|instant-clickie]] that gives [[See Invisible|See Invis]] and [[Infravision]]), and {{:Terror Forged Mask}}, which are difficult for other religions.</li>
     <li>[[Karana]] No special items or symbols besides ({{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Karana}})</li>
     <li>[[Erollisi Marr]]  No special items or symbols besides ({{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Erollisi Marr}})</li>
     <li>[[Mithaniel Marr]]  No special items or symbols besides ({{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Mithaniel Marr}})</li>
     <li>[[Rodcet Nife]]  No special items or symbols besides ({{Class And Religion Gear Search|Cleric|Rodcet Nife}})</li>
     </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

==Statistics==

